る、気の強い良妻。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"11476","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"試合中の事故が原因で、車椅子生活を送る元ボクサーの夫を献身的に看病している人妻。夫、一輝とは幼馴染みの間柄だが、藍胡の方が5歳年上の姉さん女房。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一輝が入院したのは2年前。下半身不随なので、あちらの方も役立たず。なのでものすごい欲求不満が溜まっているが、看病に精を出すことで忘れようとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変身後は「サイガーアイリス」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"知性で敵の戦法を冷静に分析し、それを受け流す水のイメージを持つ戦士。全自動洗濯機をモチーフにした銃、ビート＝ウォッシャーで戦う。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58994"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"36 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"8256","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"8256","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"8256","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"8256","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"8256","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"64 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"8256","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"51 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13185","sourceWorkId":"8256","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/4692f906ab8e3b38c2b938f81f0a9d38e3eb4c46cf8c7ec0bc7bb72fd1faeaf5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06c56dedcb140f8dc5fef29b84065e9b15cfa02aeef8da9ba1a0c541fbbc5802.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":